# Visual identity

Red, white and black only. Ignition (`#BF2026`) is a fill and a hairline accent, never a wash on a photograph or a video. Full spec: `McMaster_Rocketry_Design_System_Spec.md` v1.3 (sync to claude.ai/design via `/design-sync`).

## Heroes

Photographic and video heroes are **full colour**. Do not grayscale the media, do not map it through a duotone filter, and do not cover it with a red or black gradient veil.

Copy on a photographic/video hero sits in `.herobox` (translucent graphite panel, hairline, slight blur), sized to the text — same treatment as `/rockets/osiris`. Interior pages **without** a photo stay a solid graphite `.phead` and do **not** grow a box.

| Context | Pattern |
|---|---|
| Home | `.hero` + `.bgvid` + `.herobox` |
| Vehicle / subteam / sponsors with photo | `.phead.has-hero` + `.herobox` |
| Landscape product shots (sponsors) | add `.has-hero--wide` so cover matches the photo ratio |
| Everything else (Join, pages without a hero photo) | `.phead` only — tag, h1, lede in `.wrap` |

```html
<!-- ✅ photo hero -->
<header class="phead has-hero" style="--hero-img:url(...)">
  <div class="wrap"><div class="herobox">...</div></div>
</header>

<!-- ✅ interior page -->
<header class="phead">
  <div class="wrap"><div class="tag">...</div><h1>...</h1><p class="lede">...</p></div>
</header>

<!-- ❌ herobox without heroImage; grayscale/duotone/veil on footage -->
```

## Tagline

`site.json` `tagline` is **"Get blasted"**. It travels with the team name as a `.lockup` (display name + mono tagline) in three places only:

1. Nav brand (logo + short name + tagline)
2. Footer brand column (full name + tagline)
3. Home hero `.herobox` (full name + tagline, above the altitude)

Home document title stays `Get blasted · McMaster Rocketry`. Do not stamp the tagline on section eyebrows, interior pageheads, Join, or Sponsors.

## Page rhythm

Alternate `section.paper` (light) and plain `<section>` (dark). Every page ends with `CtaBand`. Prefer CSS utilities (`.prose`, `.prose--follow`, `.note`, `.link-underline`) over inline colour/spacing.

`/rockets` is **lineup only**: `.phead` → `.paper.fleet` → `CtaBand` (no table section).

## Crosshairs

One pair on `.phead` / `.hero`. Home and `/rockets` add a second pair on `.paper.fleet`.

## Nav

Fixed gradient scrim (never a solid bar). **Rockets** and **Subteams** are `.navitem` flyouts; other links are direct `.navlinks > a`.

Desktop row: `.navlinks { align-items: baseline }` and `.navitem { display: flex; align-items: baseline }`. Do not use `align-items: center` on the desktop link row — flyout wrappers sit lower than plain links.

Flyout on desktop: hover / focus-within. Mobile (≤980px): nested list, `align-items: stretch`.

